{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"A2A与MCP协议的区别与关系\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"A2A与MCP协议的区别与关系\" dir=\"auto\">A2A与MCP协议的区别与关系</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A2A和MCP是两个经常被比较的协议，请详细说明它们的区别、各自解决的问题、关系，以及在多Agent系统中的定位。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心区别：一纵一横，各管一层</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A2A和MCP不是竞争对手，而是解决完全不同维度问题的互补协议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MCP（Model Context Protocol）</th>\n<th>A2A（Agent-to-Agent Protocol）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>全称</strong></td>\n<td>Model Context Protocol</td>\n<td>Agent-to-Agent Protocol</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>开发者</strong></td>\n<td>Anthropic</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>连接对象</strong></td>\n<td>Agent → 工具/数据源</td>\n<td>Agent → Agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>方向</strong></td>\n<td>纵向（向下连工具）</td>\n<td>横向（向外连Agent）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>解决的问题</strong></td>\n<td>Agent如何调用工具和数据</td>\n<td>Agent之间如何协作通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>类比</strong></td>\n<td>员工的工具箱</td>\n<td>公司的协作流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核心抽象</strong></td>\n<td>Tool / Resource / Prompt</td>\n<td>Agent Card / Task / Message</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>关系图示：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">协议栈层次\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  A2A（Agent-to-Agent）                  │ ← 横向：Agent之间协作\n│  Agent Card / Task / Message             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  MCP（Model Context Protocol）            │ ← 纵向：Agent连接工具\n│  Tool / Resource / Prompt                │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Function Calling                        │ ← LLM触发工具调用\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  LLM（GPT-4 / Claude / ...）             │ ← 推理引擎\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>实际系统中的协作关系：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">复杂多Agent系统中的协议使用\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              Manager Agent                        │\n│         （通过A2A协调下属Agent）                   │\n│                                                  │\n│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐               │\n│  │ Research    │  │ Writing     │               │\n│  │ Agent       │  │ Agent       │               │\n│  │             │  │             │               │\n│  │ ┌─────────┐ │  │ ┌─────────┐ │               │\n│  │ │ MCP     │ │  │ │ MCP     │ │               │\n│  │ │ Search  │ │  │ │ FileSys │ │               │\n│  │ │ Tool    │ │  │ │ Tool    │ │               │\n│  │ └─────────┘ │  │ └─────────┘ │               │\n│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘               │\n│                                                  │\n│  Research Agent通过MCP使用搜索工具（纵向）         │\n│  Manager Agent通过A2A委派任务给Writing Agent（横向）│\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：同时使用MCP和A2A</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 一个同时使用MCP和A2A的Agent系统</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ========== MCP部分：连接工具 ==========</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> mcp <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ClientSession<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> StdioServerParameters\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 连接MCP搜索服务器</span>\nsearch_server <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> StdioServerParameters<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    command<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"python\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    args<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"search_server.py\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> ClientSession<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>search_server<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 发现工具</span>\n    tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>list_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 调用搜索工具</span>\n    result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"web_search\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AI Agent\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ========== A2A部分：Agent间协作 ==========</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ResearchAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"研究Agent：使用MCP工具，对外暴露A2A接口\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mcp_tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_connect_mcp_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">handle_task</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"处理来自其他Agent的任务（A2A接口）\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"skill\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"research\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 使用MCP工具执行任务</span>\n            search_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>mcp_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"search\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                task<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"completed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> search_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 研究Agent同时是：</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - A2A服务端：对外暴露Agent Card和Task API</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># - MCP客户端：使用MCP工具执行具体任务</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>面试回答四步法：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>说清定位差异</strong>：MCP向下连工具，A2A向外连Agent，一纵一横</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>讲透核心机制</strong>：Agent Card、Task状态机、微服务化本质</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>解释为什么需要A2A</strong>：单Agent的工具、上下文、专业能力限制</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>强调互补关系</strong>：两者同时存在、缺一不可</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：除了A2A和MCP，还有哪些Agent相关的协议？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：ANP（Agent Network Protocol）负责Agent在网络中的发现和路由（类似DNS）；WebMCP处理Agent与浏览器的交互；OpenAI的Function Calling是更底层的工具调用标准。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：在自研Agent系统中，是否必须使用A2A和MCP？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：不一定。如果系统是封闭的、工具固定的，可以直接使用框架内置的机制。但如果需要与外部Agent或工具生态集成，采用标准协议可以大幅降低集成成本。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：A2A是Google为了对抗MCP而推出的竞品。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：A2A和MCP面向的对象完全不同，不存在竞争关系。在复杂的多Agent系统中，两者通常同时存在、各司其职。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}